IAL_STATUS decodes the 'NM' semantics relied on by the material filter.\n\n### 5. Coverage Checklist\n\n| Entity | Tools called |\n|---|---|\n| TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED, TIP_DETAIL, SUBJECT_SUMMARY, ACADEMIC_TERMS, ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL, TIP_MATERIAL_STATUS | semantic_search, semantic_get (full columns) |\n| dw_3944, dw_4487, dw_4527, dw_3398, dw_3644, dw_1393, dw_3311, dw_3356, dw_1350, dw_1165, dw_3417, dw_4701, dw_1973, dw_3224 | semantic_search, semantic_get (full SQL) |\n| concept_course_material_programs, concept_subject_offering_facts, concept_academic_term_dimension, concept_department_dimension | semantic_search, semantic_get (comparisons + decision_guide) |\n| column_concept_enrollment_measures, _department_name, _material_status_key, _subject_id, _term_code, _total_units, _year_columns, _master_subject_id | semantic_search, semantic_get |\n| SUBJECT_OFFERED, SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY, LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED, SIS_DEPARTMENT | semantic_search descs + concept comparisons (sufficient to exclude; not in gold tables) |\n| mysql_query verification | attempted 5× — all failed with server-side auth error `1045 Access denied for user 'root'@'localhost'` (noted explicitly; verification impossible this session) |\n\n### 6. Recommendation\n\n**6a. Tables/columns**: `TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED` (OFFER_DEPT_NAME, NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS, SUBJECT_ID) ⋈ `TIP_DETAIL` (SUBJECT_ID, TIP_MATERIAL_STATUS_KEY <> 'NM') for the department stats CTE; `SUBJECT_SUMMARY` (SUBJECT_ID, SUBJECT_TITLE, DEPARTMENT_NAME, SCHOOL_NAME='Engineering', TOTAL_UNITS=1, TERM_CODE) ⋈ `ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL` ⋈ `ACADEMIC_TERMS` (ACADEMIC_YEAR, TERM_DESCRIPTION) for the subject CTE; join CTEs on OFFER_DEPT_NAME = DEPARTMENT_NAME.\n\n**6b. SQL approach**: two CTEs mirroring precedents dw_3944/dw_4487 (Engineering half, including the double term-table inner join and RANK window) and dw_4527/dw_3356 (bare STDDEV over TIP enrollment); inner join on department name; order by enrollment_stddev DESC, ACADEMIC_YEAR, rank. SELECT l